import{_ as t,o as n,c as i,a2 as a}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const g=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 835 | Transcended Ones and Education | Establishment of the Transcended-One Training Academy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 835 | Transcended Ones and Education | Establishment of the Transcended-One Training Academy","no":835,"module":4,"tags":["Transcendence","Training Academy","Institution Establishment","Elite Education","On-Post Mentoring"],"related":["37-Symbiotic Education System","720-Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post","17-Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards","834-Transcended-One Education System Overview"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0835_模块4-超脱者与教育-培训学院设立.md","filePath":"en/0835_模块4-超脱者与教育-培训学院设立.md"}'),o={name:"en/0835_模块4-超脱者与教育-培训学院设立.md"};function s(r,e,d,l,c,u){return n(),i("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[a('<h1 id="entry-835-transcended-ones-and-education-establishment-of-the-transcended-one-training-academy" tabindex="-1">Entry 835 | Transcended Ones and Education | Establishment of the Transcended-One Training Academy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-835-transcended-ones-and-education-establishment-of-the-transcended-one-training-academy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 835 | Transcended Ones and Education | Establishment of the Transcended-One Training Academy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 4 · Transcendence Orthodox Definition Library | Benchmark base: Documents 37, 17, 720, 834</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-an-academy-is-not-a-cave-dwelling-sect-taking-disciples-but-engineering-batch-producing-qualified-transcended-ones" tabindex="-1">Introduction: an academy is not &quot;a cave-dwelling sect taking disciples,&quot; but engineering batch-producing qualified transcended ones <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-an-academy-is-not-a-cave-dwelling-sect-taking-disciples-but-engineering-batch-producing-qualified-transcended-ones" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: an academy is not &quot;a cave-dwelling sect taking disciples,&quot; but engineering batch-producing qualified transcended ones&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The old world cultivated the next generation of strong ones by &quot;cave-dwelling sect taking disciples&quot; — one strong one occupies a mountain, takes three to five closed-door disciples, resources privately transmitted, lineage transmitted by mood. The result: once the strong one dies, the lineage breaks; whether the disciple succeeds depends entirely on the master&#39;s whim. What Heng Yuan Zhou wants to cultivate is not &quot;some strong one&#39;s inheritor,&quot; but <strong>generation after generation of qualified transcended-one post officeholders.</strong> This requires running an academy — turning &quot;how to become a transcended one&quot; from private experience into public engineering. This entry explains why the Transcended-One Training Academy must be established, by what standards, and what prevents the academy itself from degrading into a new sect monopoly.</p><p>Six top-level axioms all take effect: <strong>the anti-predation axiom</strong> requires the academy not run sect private hoarding, not monopolize resources, doors open to Myriad Ranks; <strong>the republican axiom of Myriad Races</strong> requires enrollment not ask origin or race, only potential and heart-nature; <strong>the collective ascension axiom</strong> requires the academy&#39;s output be not &quot;stronger individuals,&quot; but &quot;more qualified co-building post-holders&quot;; <strong>the causal self-discipline axiom</strong> requires the academy&#39;s teaching and assessment throughout traceable; <strong>the law-first axiom</strong> requires the academy&#39;s cultivation standard itself be law-level self-consistent, not casually changed by plot needs.</p><p>Among them, <strong>Axiom 6 · Universal Equal Infinite Law</strong> is the sixth pillar: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will not be eliminated by the times; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. The old cosmos&#39; resources and Great Dao are limited, necessarily leading to predatory involution; the Anchor Symbiotic everyone inherently possesses infinite origin, predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><p>The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning.</p><h2 id="i-necessity-of-establishment-why-cave-dwelling-sect-taking-disciples-can-no-longer-continue" tabindex="-1">I. Necessity of Establishment: Why &quot;Cave-Dwelling Sect Taking Disciples&quot; Can No Longer Continue <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-necessity-of-establishment-why-cave-dwelling-sect-taking-disciples-can-no-longer-continue" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. Necessity of Establishment: Why &quot;Cave-Dwelling Sect Taking Disciples&quot; Can No Longer Continue&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Leaving &quot;cultivating transcended ones&quot; to private cave-dwelling sects, the old world left three bloody lessons:</p><ol><li><strong>Lineage dies with the person</strong>: the strong one dies from sudden enlightenment; the disciple may not catch it; a millennium of lineage returns to zero overnight. This is the largest source of energy-level waste — one insight served one person, then dissipated forever.</li><li><strong>Selection by mood</strong>: whom to take as disciple depends entirely on the master&#39;s likes and dislikes; truly good seedlings may be missed because &quot;not pleasing&quot;; opportunists rise through taking sides.</li><li><strong>No unified standard</strong>: what counts as a &quot;qualified transcended one&quot;? No unified standard. The result is a batch of &quot;strong but without responsibility&quot; individuals — combat power enough, but heart-nature and civilizational-weight assessment not passing, ultimately becoming hang-up-retirement-style strong ones (see entry 729 critique series).</li></ol><p>The fundamental reason for academy establishment is to engineer these three things: <strong>lineage deposition, selection standardization, unified qualification line.</strong></p><h2 id="ii-the-academy-s-positioning-and-admission" tabindex="-1">II. The Academy&#39;s Positioning and Admission <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-the-academy-s-positioning-and-admission" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. The Academy&#39;s Positioning and Admission&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The Transcended-One Training Academy is not an ordinary elite school; it is the Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm&#39;s &quot;post-qualification&quot; training and certification institution. Its positioning has three:</p><ul><li><strong>The hyper-multiverse lineage layer&#39;s main entrance</strong>: takes high-potential cultivators from the nine realms&#39; mid-to-late stage (Dao Origin Realm and above), delivering qualified seedlings to Boundary-Breaking, World-Creation, Origin, Multiverse Realm, even Balanced Anchor Hyper-Multiverse Realm;</li><li><strong>Post-duty training ground</strong>: students do not only study cultivation, but also intern at posts — law-network maintenance, Myriad-Rank evolution guidance, Alaya-Network supervision, civilizational correction and other post rotations (corresponding to entries 711–720&#39;s post-duty system);</li><li><strong>Qualification-line certification office</strong>: students graduating must pass the &quot;plane-sovereign strong one&#39;s four-dimensional assessment&quot; (Power 40 / Heart-nature 25 / Contribution 20 / Responsibility 15, see Document 17), none may be missing.</li></ul><p>Admission standards have only two hard lines: <strong>potential meets standard</strong> and <strong>heart-nature meets standard.</strong> The former looks at cultivation talent and system-compatibility assessment; the latter looks at whether there is a predatory record and whether one identifies with the republican axiom of Myriad Races. Origin, race, wealth, gender are never thresholds — this is the republican axiom of Myriad Races&#39; direct landing.</p><h2 id="iii-the-academy-s-curriculum-structure" tabindex="-1">III. The Academy&#39;s Curriculum Structure <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-the-academy-s-curriculum-structure" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. The Academy&#39;s Curriculum Structure&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The academy&#39;s curriculum is not &quot;deeper manuals,&quot; but four modules&#39; combination:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Module</th><th>Content</th><th>Proportion</th><th>Corresponding Axiom</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Power module</td><td>Hyper-multiverse-grade manuals, law weaving, new-cosmos frontier technology</td><td>40%</td><td>Collective ascension</td></tr><tr><td>Heart-nature module</td><td>Anti-predation ethics, short-cut-inner-demon recognition, beings&#39; origin greed · causal self-discipline</td><td>25%</td><td>Anti-predation</td></tr><tr><td>Contribution module</td><td>Post internship, Myriad-Rank feedback, increment-development actual combat</td><td>20%</td><td>Collective ascension</td></tr><tr><td>Responsibility module</td><td>Civilizational-weight assessment, supervision obedience, historical-correction awareness</td><td>15%</td><td>Causal self-discipline</td></tr></tbody></table><p>This proportion directly copies the plane-sovereign strong one&#39;s four-dimensional assessment — <strong>power is only four-tenths; heart-nature, contribution, responsibility together are six-tenths.</strong> The academy from curriculum structure itself negates the old definition of &quot;strong is transcendence&quot;: a student with full combat power but without responsibility and contribution cannot graduate.</p><h2 id="iv-three-locks-preventing-the-academy-from-degrading-into-a-new-sect" tabindex="-1">IV. Three Locks Preventing the Academy from Degrading into a New Sect <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-three-locks-preventing-the-academy-from-degrading-into-a-new-sect" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Three Locks Preventing the Academy from Degrading into a New Sect&quot;">​</a></h2><p>The academy itself may also degenerate. The old world&#39;s sects are from &quot;teaching community&quot; degraded into &quot;resource-monopoly organization.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou for this applied three locks:</p><ol><li><strong>Faculty rotation lock</strong>: transcended ones teaching at the academy is post duty, term system, rotated at term end; not allowed to long-term occupy the lectern forming &quot;faction.&quot; Teaching results count into civilizational weight, but seniority is not ranked by number of disciples.</li><li><strong>Resource-open lock</strong>: all academy manuals, textbooks, teaching videos open through the Selfless Dao network-wide; off-campus cultivators and on-campus students enjoy equal knowledge access. The academy only provides &quot;guidance and practical training,&quot; does not monopolize &quot;knowledge itself.&quot;</li><li><strong>Alaya supervision lock</strong>: enrollment, assessment, graduation whole process leaves traces under Alaya Network + multi-layer supervision. Any &quot;pre-decided,&quot; &quot;recommended admission,&quot; &quot;discriminating against some race&quot; anomaly signals auto-trigger the Anchor Supervisory Committee&#39;s investigation.</li></ol><p>Three locks combined, the academy is a &quot;public practical-training ground,&quot; not &quot;some faction&#39;s private school.&quot;</p><h2 id="v-five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">V. Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: the academy deposits the strong one&#39;s private lineage into standardized courses; letting one insight perpetually serve Myriad Ranks, eliminating &quot;person dies Dao extinguishes&quot; maximum waste</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: three locks seal the academy&#39;s degradation into sect-monopoly possibility; knowledge opens network-wide, no sect private hoarding</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: under the Tang-Luo favor system, the next generation of strong ones through Gu Chensha&#39;s one-time grace succeeds; no standardized cultivation, ceiling locked; Heng Yuan Zhou uses the academy to engineer and perpetually batch-produce qualified transcended ones</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: enrollment only looks at potential and heart-nature, not race origin; curriculum adapts for Myriad Ranks&#39; five lineages&#39; life forms</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: academy knowledge opens network-wide, practical-training post rotations public, graduation standard four-dimensional queryable</li></ul><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Establishment of the Transcended-One Training Academy marks &quot;how to become a transcended one&quot; from private experience into public engineering. It uses standardized selection, four-dimensional assessment, and three locks to ensure output is not &quot;stronger individuals,&quot; but &quot;qualified co-building post-holders.&quot; When the strongest&#39;s cultivation may also be engineered, supervised, and perpetually iterated, the transcended-one ranks will not break generations; Myriad Ranks will always have qualified leaders.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/37-共生教育体系.html">Entry 37 · Symbiotic Education System</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/17-位面至高强者标准.html">Entry 17 · Plane-Sovereign Strong-One Standards</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/720_模块4-超脱者培训与传承岗.html">Entry 720 · Transcended-One Training and Lineage Post</a> · <a href="./../wanling-hengmao-origin-universe-archive/docs/zh/834_模块4-超脱者与教育-总论.html">Entry 834 · Transcended-One Education System Overview</a></li></ul>',29)])])}const m=t(o,[["render",s]]);export{g as __pageData,m as default};
